  nameText: 
  dialogueText: 'The Reality of the Struggle: Public health data from organizations
    like the CDC show that while millions of teens experience persistent feelings
    of sadness, depression, or thoughts of self-harm, support and recovery are possible.
    Reaching out to a friend, family member, or professional can be the most important
    turning point. '
